OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F338A1785264513
OL,3,CThousands of potentially dangerous
OL,4,Cproducts seized by Trading Standards
OL,6,FThousands of potentially dangerous
OL,7,Fproducts have been seized from Hull
OL,8,FShops after previous raids recovered
OL,9,Ftoys containing a cancer-causing
OL,10,Fchemical.
OL,12,FToys, baby feeding bottles, candles,
OL,13,Ftobacco products and more are among
OL,14,Fcounterfeit items seized by Hull City
OL,15,FCouncil's Trading Standards officers.
OL,17,FThe two day operation, dubbed
OL,18,FOperation Bramble, was organised
OL,19,Ffollowing a flood of information from
OL,20,Fmembers of the public.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/5
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
