FL,339,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F338A1785264513
OL,3,CThousands of potentially dangerous
OL,4,Cproducts seized by Trading Standards
OL,6,FThe tips were submitted after the
OL,7,Fcouncil revealed previous seizures had
OL,8,Frecovered over 1,000 contaminated
OL,9,Fcounterfeit toys, some of which
OL,10,Fcontained the cancer-causing chemical
OL,11,Fbenzene.
OL,13,FThe latest seizures, which saw van-
OL,14,Floads of goods recovered, were the
OL,15,Fresult of visits to more than 60 local
OL,16,Fretailers.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/5
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,339,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F338A1785264513
OL,3,CThousands of potentially dangerous
OL,4,Cproducts seized by Trading Standards
OL,6,FItems removed from sale during
OL,7,FOperation Bramble included candles
OL,8,Fwhich could pose a fire risk,
OL,9,Fcosmetics which could contain
OL,10,Fprohibited or restricted substances
OL,11,Fcapable of causing burns, and baby
OL,12,Ffeeding bottles which failed to comply
OL,13,Fwith safety standards designed to
OL,14,Fprotect infants.
OL,16,FCounterfeit tobacco products and
OL,17,Fparaphernalia were also amongst the
OL,18,Ffindings, none of which had undergone
OL,19,Fsafety checks legally necessary to
OL,20,Fmeet standards for sale in the UK.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/5
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
