PN,33804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F338A1785264513
OL,3,CThousands of potentially dangerous
OL,4,Cproducts seized by Trading Standards
OL,6,FCllr Ted Dolman whose portfolio
OL,7,Fincludes Trading Standards, said:
OL,8,F"Being out on the streets and
OL,9,Fexperiencing the operation first-hand
OL,10,Fwas an incredible insight into the
OL,11,Fscale of the problem that is illicit
OL,12,Fgoods on our streets, and the work the
OL,13,Fteams do to protect the public from
OL,14,Fharm.
OL,26,@pD@AOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/5
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
