OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,339,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F338A1785264513
OL,3,CThousands of potentially dangerous
OL,4,Cproducts seized by Trading Standards
OL,6,F"The items seized during Operation
OL,7,FBramble would have potentially put
OL,8,Fchildren, individuals and entire
OL,9,Fhouseholds at risk. We must be
OL,10,Fabsolutely clear that these are not
OL,11,Fsimply technical breaches of product
OL,12,Fsafety legislation.
OL,14,F"These are products which could expose
OL,15,Fconsumers to serious risks, including
OL,16,Fchoking, poisoning, burns, chemical
OL,17,Fexposure, fire, and other potentially
OL,18,Flife-changing injuries."
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/5
